# PlatoLives v5.2.0 Release Notes

### Highlights & Architecture Updates

*
  - Full ASCII 0x20..0x7E character set integration directly from the authentic Heathkit H-19 ROM (444-29, 2716 EPROM, CRC32: 0xd595ac1d).
  - True 2-pixel descenders on baseline row 7 for 'g', 'j', 'p', 'q', 'y' and punctuation.
  - Physical DVBST cathode-ray beam simulation: Gaussian spot bloom (sigma 1.80f), dielectric core saturation (intensity 1.10f), and analog deflection wiggle.
  - Bug fixing
